      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "UI.Text have limitation of text length that can prevents writing all of long credits. Also, Scroll View component may costs performance on optimized world because it uses mask rendering.\nWe also needs credits info for avatars because most of user shaders need to be credited, but we currently have not enough space for it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
