  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-07-01T04:01:20.125Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "People may collaborate, want to share discord info, and many CC assets require creator credit, would be great to have this info accessible in the menu, especially when adding a giant billboard of text doesn’t fit in the world well.",
